(6196513, 915362, 121073, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the image seems a bit flat/dull though (colours/contrast).</td>', 'I like the idea, the image seems a bit flat/dull though (colours/contrast).', '2010-10-20 08:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
