(6196768, 914504, 6202, '<td valign="top">I simply love this. Lighting is fantastic.</td>', 'I simply love this. Lighting is fantastic.', '2010-10-20 12:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196771, 914779, 6202, '<td valign="top">This has some awesome appeal to it.  Those bright red lips just pull you in even more.</td>', 'This has some awesome appeal to it.  Those bright red lips just pull you in even more.', '2010-10-20 12:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196785, 914525, 101702, '<td valign="top">You''re supposed to show the body part in the image, not hide them with arms! LOL</td>', 'You''re supposed to show the body part in the image, not hide them with arms! LOL', '2010-10-20 12:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196786, 915233, 101702, '<td valign="top">The challenge brief was to have both the body part, and it''s mirror in the environment. I don''t see the body part, only the environment.</td>', 'The challenge brief was to have both the body part, and it''s mirror in the environment. I don''t see the body part, only the environment.', '2010-10-20 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196792, 915371, 101702, '<td valign="top">I like the way she has a heart on her forearm mirroring the Florence and the Machine album cover. The challenge brief was to have both the body part, and it''s mirror in the environment. I don''t see the body part, only the environment. I realise it''s sort of hard to show the real lungs so I will cut you some slack on that one - others have not been spared the minus point for the technical DNMC. I think this image could have been a bit sharper, and I find the positioning of some of the flowers a distraction (the sliver of yellow on the left, the orange one growing from her armpit). They may have looked better in isolation from the body rather than overlapping. Is that bits of daylight showing through the tree top left? If so, maybe flowers inserted there might help disguise that element. 10 out of 10 for effort... 5 out of 10 for execution.</td>', 'I like the way she has a heart on her forearm mirroring the Florence and the Machine album cover. The challenge brief was to have both the body part, and it''s mirror in the environment. I don''t see the body part, only the environment. I realise it''s sort of hard to show the real lungs so I will cut you some slack on that one - others have not been spared the minus point for the technical DNMC. I think this image could have been a bit sharper, and I find the positioning of some of the flowers a distraction (the sliver of yellow on the left, the orange one growing from her armpit). They may have looked better in isolation from the body rather than overlapping. Is that bits of daylight showing through the tree top left? If so, maybe flowers inserted there might help disguise that element. 10 out of 10 for effort... 5 out of 10 for execution.', '2010-10-20 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196894, 915228, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''m understaning the link between body shape and how that is mirrored in the environment?</td>', 'I''m not sure I''m understaning the link between body shape and how that is mirrored in the environment?', '2010-10-20 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196897, 915130, 101702, '<td valign="top">Just about the only photo in the challenge that actually meets the challenge, and isn''t a ball/head. Good work, and a ribbon contender for sure. Nice sharp image and nice lines.</td>', 'Just about the only photo in the challenge that actually meets the challenge, and isn''t a ball/head. Good work, and a ribbon contender for sure. Nice sharp image and nice lines.', '2010-10-20 14:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196898, 914579, 101702, '<td valign="top">You took the "easy" option of a head and a ball (as suggested in the challenge brief). However, yours is the only photo in this challenge that actually looks like some effort went into making it. Nice compositional balance, good choice of tones and colours. Ribbon contender.</td>', 'You took the "easy" option of a head and a ball (as suggested in the challenge brief). However, yours is the only photo in this challenge that actually looks like some effort went into making it. Nice compositional balance, good choice of tones and colours. Ribbon contender.', '2010-10-20 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196907, 914952, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and I''m always a sucker for a naked bum, but I just don''t feel the link between a body shape and the environment. Are you saying her body overall looks like a rock? Or that her naked bum looks like the rock she is on. Just not quite getting it, sorry.</td>', 'Nice shot and I''m always a sucker for a naked bum, but I just don''t feel the link between a body shape and the environment. Are you saying her body overall looks like a rock? Or that her naked bum looks like the rock she is on. Just not quite getting it, sorry.', '2010-10-20 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196908, 915219, 26001, '<td valign="top">she looks like Ellie Kemper(Erin Hannon in "The Office") :)</td>', 'she looks like Ellie Kemper(Erin Hannon in "The Office") :)', '2010-10-20 15:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196954, 914818, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very creatively done!</td>', 'Very creatively done!', '2010-10-20 16:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196955, 915399, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of B&amp;W, but I would have been interested to see the whole hand, or grip.</td>', 'I like the choice of B&W, but I would have been interested to see the whole hand, or grip.', '2010-10-20 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196957, 914949, 35513, '<td valign="top">Whoah, that''s creepy!  Good detail and nice editing!  I think I might enjoy it a bit more in color as opposed to B&amp;W, but I''ll admit that the B&amp;W does make the camera lens less noticeable/more natural as the iris.</td>', 'Whoah, that''s creepy!  Good detail and nice editing!  I think I might enjoy it a bit more in color as opposed to B&W, but I''ll admit that the B&W does make the camera lens less noticeable/more natural as the iris.', '2010-10-20 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196960, 915371, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept!</td>', 'Interesting concept!', '2010-10-20 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6196963, 915398, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!!!  I can''t really think of anything to gripe about! :-)  Nice lighting, good B&amp;W tones, creative idea....well executed!</td>', 'Very nicely done!!!  I can''t really think of anything to gripe about! :-)  Nice lighting, good B&W tones, creative idea....well executed!', '2010-10-20 16:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
