(6197224, 915431, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like how the shadows of your hands wrap around the lobster, especially since your hands are out of focus (I don''t particularly care for that part).</td>', 'Nice idea. I like how the shadows of your hands wrap around the lobster, especially since your hands are out of focus (I don''t particularly care for that part).', '2010-10-20 22:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197225, 914871, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, especially the outstretched finders. Black and white was a perfect choice for this photo.</td>', 'Very nicely done, especially the outstretched finders. Black and white was a perfect choice for this photo.', '2010-10-20 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197227, 915194, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. The high key background effect works well for this, although I would have like to see some clone tool use to remove some of the distractions.</td>', 'Cute photo. The high key background effect works well for this, although I would have like to see some clone tool use to remove some of the distractions.', '2010-10-20 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197229, 915387, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. I like the composition used, although that on camera flash definitely detracts a bit (it would have probably been a good idea to bounce that flash off something.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. I like the composition used, although that on camera flash definitely detracts a bit (it would have probably been a good idea to bounce that flash off something.', '2010-10-20 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197231, 915130, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, I would have never thought of a saxophone as a similar shape to a body part. Perfectly done high key background with nice sharp line and no bleeding of the highlights.</td>', 'Wow, I would have never thought of a saxophone as a similar shape to a body part. Perfectly done high key background with nice sharp line and no bleeding of the highlights.', '2010-10-20 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197234, 915418, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well setup photo, especially the look on the guy''s face. I do get the feeling that this photo has been over-sharpened a bit, which is hurting to overall shot.</td>', 'Well setup photo, especially the look on the guy''s face. I do get the feeling that this photo has been over-sharpened a bit, which is hurting to overall shot.', '2010-10-20 22:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197237, 915362, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great catch with noticing the setup. It''s too bad the photo feels like it lacks extreme sharpness, especially on the person.</td>', 'Great catch with noticing the setup. It''s too bad the photo feels like it lacks extreme sharpness, especially on the person.', '2010-10-20 22:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6197239, 914525, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and composition of this photo. I definitely don''t like the use of selective desaturation here, it makes the model look like a corpse!</td>', 'Nice setup and composition of this photo. I definitely don''t like the use of selective desaturation here, it makes the model look like a corpse!', '2010-10-20 22:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
