(6201139, 915196, 61396, '<td valign="top">This obviously meets the challenge, since a shadow, more often than not, has some similarity to the body it is a shadow of. This is usually pretty trivial, but here however, I find that the motion blur is actually the true counterpart of the body. It is as graceful and subtle and is flowing just like her foot. So the way I see it, you meet the challenge two ways, which is not trivial at all. <br/> <br/>Thanks for making me stop and think.</td>', 'This obviously meets the challenge, since a shadow, more often than not, has some similarity to the body it is a shadow of. This is usually pretty trivial, but here however, I find that the motion blur is actually the true counterpart of the body. It is as graceful and subtle and is flowing just like her foot. So the way I see it, you meet the challenge two ways, which is not trivial at all.  Thanks for making me stop and think.', '2010-10-25 19:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
