(6204154, 915418, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wendy - I didn''t see the arm blur as a big deal. I was more fascinated by the fact that the man allowed himself to pose in the sand like that lol.  His expression and the boy''s action was funny.  Congrats on the top 10 too, neighbor!  :)</td>', 'Wendy - I didn''t see the arm blur as a big deal. I was more fascinated by the fact that the man allowed himself to pose in the sand like that lol.  His expression and the boy''s action was funny.  Congrats on the top 10 too, neighbor!  :)', '2010-10-29 09:11:06.000000', NULL, 0),
