(6208756, 914818, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh what a shame - but the DQ doesn''t take away from the fact that you have taken a photo that nailed the challenge, that was subtle, quietly clever, and aesthetically pleasing in its own right.<br/> <br/><i>Edit - and I''m sure you get to keep th posthumous Red, which is far more sought after than an HM!</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-02 13:58:29.</i></td>', 'Oh what a shame - but the DQ doesn''t take away from the fact that you have taken a photo that nailed the challenge, that was subtle, quietly clever, and aesthetically pleasing in its own right. Edit - and I''m sure you get to keep th posthumous Red, which is far more sought after than an HM!', '2010-11-02 13:57:11.000000', '2010-11-02 13:58:29.000000', 0),
