(6209936, 915407, 54645, '<td valign="top">I definitely enjoyed your interpretation of the challenge. Hard to believe how long it took to resolve the validation. I doubt many people were fooled, as the art rule requires, as it''s cleary a screen. Sorry for the DQ Penny!</td>', 'I definitely enjoyed your interpretation of the challenge. Hard to believe how long it took to resolve the validation. I doubt many people were fooled, as the art rule requires, as it''s cleary a screen. Sorry for the DQ Penny!', '2010-11-03 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6210162, 914818, 113591, '<td valign="top">Well.... We live and learn. The learn part a bit slowly, it seems. I want to re-iterate what I said, that the comments are much more appreciated than any score, so.... I''ll follow the rules better, and enjoy your comments, and the learning experience.</td>', 'Well.... We live and learn. The learn part a bit slowly, it seems. I want to re-iterate what I said, that the comments are much more appreciated than any score, so.... I''ll follow the rules better, and enjoy your comments, and the learning experience.', '2010-11-03 11:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6210976, 914949, 114565, '<td valign="top">Dopey me for not understanding the rules correctly!<br/> <br/>Shame cos I spent so much time on this photo and really enjoyed it, despite upsetting my family due to "playing on the computer" rather than doing housework!<br/> <br/>Even though it was disqualified I love the end result and think it is the most artistic thing I have ever done, I hope that future challenges will be as productive without the DQ!<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Dopey me for not understanding the rules correctly! Shame cos I spent so much time on this photo and really enjoyed it, despite upsetting my family due to "playing on the computer" rather than doing housework! Even though it was disqualified I love the end result and think it is the most artistic thing I have ever done, I hope that future challenges will be as productive without the DQ! Thanks for the comments.', '2010-11-03 22:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6211529, 914726, 43463, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and wonderfully composed! I love how you skillfully convey the imagery of life lines that exist both in the leaf of the plant and that of the human hand. Wonderful symbolism of Life; Nature and all it''s connections. Congrats on the Red!</td>', 'Excellent idea and wonderfully composed! I love how you skillfully convey the imagery of life lines that exist both in the leaf of the plant and that of the human hand. Wonderful symbolism of Life; Nature and all it''s connections. Congrats on the Red!', '2010-11-04 11:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6211623, 914949, 117534, '<td valign="top">Looking thru your portfolio and this is SERIOUSLY GOOD!!!  and the comments from the real seasoned photographers while it was in the challenge attest to that!!  Even though it (ahemm) kinda broke the rules it shows great imangination and artistic flair!!  Keep on shootin'' your doing good so far!!  (oh I really liked your desert road too)</td>', 'Looking thru your portfolio and this is SERIOUSLY GOOD!!!  and the comments from the real seasoned photographers while it was in the challenge attest to that!!  Even though it (ahemm) kinda broke the rules it shows great imangination and artistic flair!!  Keep on shootin'' your doing good so far!!  (oh I really liked your desert road too)', '2010-11-04 13:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
